<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-17T23:02:30.401Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:02:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Sanctions have been imposed on eight Israeli construction firms for building West Bank settlements, aiming to support a two-state solution. Israeli airstrikes hit Gaza’s Nasser Hospital, killing a doctor and a child, and later killed three Hamas militants, including an attacker from the Oct. 7 assault. In the West Bank, Israeli settlers entered a Palestinian village near Jericho, clashing with residents, seizing homes, and a car-ramming incident was judged not a terror attack. Winter rains have deepened the humanitarian crisis in Gaza, while the conflict has caused 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvglr977x3z0o?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/15/myanmar-rohingya-genocide-icj&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168796&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPY2haN1ZfRHhlNnJROXc1ZXlUWnc0Si00Ui1RdFB2N1NfX0x0NEJ1b2NSSVdGTUlDaVJLWjZFM2NtaTJYVEc3dmZnbzQ1MHBJcm5OSV9FaHZmbkZqMlk0ckRpaHJxalp2WXNvQy1YYkZ0Nnl3aWc0VndzN04tcWh6TmY0NmdWZS1OT0h4TWROQWtFczl6Y3VYN0Utbmhhcko3aHlCMjRMXzh6NGlTMHZTU3ltNV9CdldwQy11enVDZkFHUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE82NWVJVXJnakpSMkZfN1dTa3JuU01tM3RrQXNWdnJGYUlRWllERkgwNVRpaDlsUHE2QkpwX2J2OXJkOVZpMklvUjdYS0c4UkFDU3UzcEl2UUMwakk?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxPUXpQZHpnYXJKdVpCV2tTVWtQMlJNMk1fZG1tdVJSN3p1dVV4Yl8